{"id":"chiang-mai","name":"清迈","en":"Chiang Mai","country":"Thailand","lat":18.8,"lng":98.98,"dek":"一座被护城河圈住的旧都，节奏慢得像午后树影。","history":"清迈的地基上，原先只是罗涡人的城镇。1296年，孟莱王把都城从清莱迁到平河西岸，筑起城墙与护城河，将这里命名为“新城市”。孟莱王的母亲是西双版纳景洪统治者的女儿，父亲是清盛一带的统治者。他领导兰纳与西双版纳傣族共同抵抗蒙古军队，使兰纳迎来第一次高峰。后人把一部流传于泰北和西双版纳的法典称作“孟莱法典”，以纪念这位建城者。\n\n14世纪以后，佛教在兰纳扎根，清迈城内佛寺渐多。1477年，提洛卡拉王在柴迪隆寺召集第八次世界佛教会议，这是清迈作为宗教中心的黄金年代。但不过百年，这座城市便落入缅甸控制，前后近两百年。1774年，吞武里王朝的郑昭从缅甸手中夺回清迈，城市重新回到暹罗的势力范围。\n\n19世纪后期，拉玛五世撤销藩王制度，清迈设府，成为清迈府首府。那次行政调整结束了地方王权的自治形态，也把清迈更紧密地编入现代泰国的版图。1980年代起，旅游业和城市扩张加速，清迈从安静的北方旧都变成今日的泰北中心。","culture":"清迈的日常语言是北部泰语，与景洪、琅勃拉邦、景栋等旧兰纳城市方言接近，至今仍可互通。书面老傣仂文主要留存于学术和宗教场合，一般书写已改用标准泰文。这种语言上的延续，使清迈在泰国城市中保留了明显的北方身份。\n\n当地节庆围绕水与佛事展开。每年11月前后水灯节期间，人们把香蕉叶和花朵做成水灯放入河中，同时施放纸扎天灯。4月的泼水节则把整座古城变成水的现场，帕邢寺会为佛像净身，游行和选美穿插其间。2月初的花卉节只有三天，正值热带花卉盛开。","pull":"护城河还在，兰纳的旧都也还在。","sights":[{"name":"清迈古城","orig":"Chiang Mai Old City","intro":"1296年孟莱王所建的方形城，每边约1.5公里，四围有城墙与护城河。城内寺庙、老宅与窄巷交错，是清迈旧日格局最直观的留存。1990年起市政府禁止在市区建高楼，以保护古城景观。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"素贴寺","orig":"Wat Phra That Doi Suthep","intro":"位于素贴山海拔约1053米处，可俯瞰清迈市区。沿山路上行约18.5公里，寺庙金塔与回廊是泰北佛教建筑的代表。天气晴朗时，远眺市区与机场方向的视野开阔。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Phra_That_Doi_Suthep_01.jpg/960px-Phra_That_Doi_Suthep_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E9%BE%99%E5%AF%BA"},{"name":"蒲屏宫","orig":"Bhubing Palace","intro":"泰国王室的冬宫，建于1961年，位于素贴寺再往山上约4.5公里处。宫殿本身朴素，但花园打理细致，热带花卉、巨竹与老树沿坡分布。王室不在时对公众开放，着装要求严格。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Bhubing_Palace_%287981858020%29.jpg/960px-Bhubing_Palace_%287981858020%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhubing_Palace"},{"name":"柴迪隆寺","orig":"Wat Chedi Luang","intro":"清迈古城中央的大塔寺，兰纳风格佛塔建于1441年，原高约90米。1545年大地震和16世纪战事后塔身受损，现存约60米。这里也是1477年第八次世界佛教会议的召开地。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Chedi_Luang_-_Chiang_Mai.jpg/960px-Chedi_Luang_-_Chiang_Mai.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":623},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%91%E8%BF%AA%E9%BE%99%E5%AF%BA"},{"name":"帕邢寺","orig":"Wat Phra Singh","intro":"位于古城内，建于1345年，由坎福王为安放父亲灵骨而建。寺内主要佛像具有泰北风格，每年泼水节时会在寺中为佛像净身。寺院建筑和壁画保留较多兰纳传统细节。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Watphrasinghmap.png/960px-Watphrasinghmap.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":836},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%95%E9%82%A2%E5%AF%BA"}],"foods":[{"name":"考甩","orig":"Khao Soi","intro":"清迈最具代表性的面食，黄色小麦面条浸在咖喱汤中，传统配鸡腿或牛肉，再撒上炸脆的面条。吃时加入酸菜、青柠和红葱头，路边摊和餐厅都很常见。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Khao_Soi_Northern_Thai_food_%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2_%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87.jpg/960px-Khao_Soi_Northern_Thai_food_%E0%B8%82%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2_%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":768},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khao_soi"},{"name":"杭莱","orig":"Hang Lay","intro":"兰纳风格的猪肉咖喱，口味偏甜，常加入姜、蒜和罗望子，与中部泰式咖喱不同。多配糯米饭食用，是清迈北部菜的代表之一。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"赛乌阿","orig":"Sai Ua","intro":"泰北猪肉香肠，用辣椒、香茅、南姜和皱皮柠檬叶调味，香气浓烈。烤后切片与糯米饭同吃，夜市和街边食摊常见。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Lao_Sai_Oua.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":686},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sai_oua"},{"name":"芒果糯米饭","orig":"Khao Niao Mamuang","intro":"椰浆煮糯米配熟芒果，是清迈常见甜点。街头摊档和甜品店均有供应，多撒脆米或淋椰浆。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Mango_sticy_rice_%283859549574%29.jpg/960px-Mango_sticy_rice_%283859549574%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%92%E6%9E%9C%E7%B3%AF%E7%B1%B3%E9%A5%AD"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Chiangmai_view.jpg/1280px-Chiangmai_view.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Chiang_Mai_-_East_gate_of_the_city_wall_-_0001.jpg/1280px-Chiang_Mai_-_East_gate_of_the_city_wall_-_0001.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":775}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[98.9426458,18.7976919],[98.9459181,18.7986466],[98.946079,18.7950765],[98.9605214,18.7909566],[98.9591145,18.7868443],[98.9628187,18.787022],[98.9651361,18.7835368],[98.970243,18.7835635],[98.9706534,18.7816437],[98.9716619,18.7815624],[98.9722413,18.7834111],[98.9732337,18.7831978],[98.9728796,18.7863872],[98.9757442,18.7860546],[98.9753178,18.7792567],[98.9760232,18.7770524],[98.9737809,18.7758487],[98.973341,18.7734616],[98.9707714,18.7729131],[98.9707661,18.7720191],[98.9761358,18.7699723],[98.9763585,18.7677755],[98.9909229,18.7651369],[99.0009704,18.7568752],[99.0137887,18.7590086],[99.0298122,18.7642988],[99.0267116,18.7859657],[99.0198344,18.8010791],[99.0198554,18.8047057],[99.0186551,18.8038572],[99.016369,18.8071499],[99.0126058,18.8094096],[99.0034783,18.8103871],[99.0018046,18.8150943],[98.9951634,18.8226701],[98.9977813,18.8287834],[98.992272,18.8331854],[98.989284,18.840339],[98.985417,18.8441696],[98.9776647,18.8404558],[98.9752607,18.8424538],[98.9709353,18.8418593],[98.9767581,18.8278821],[98.9820582,18.8117556],[98.9777157,18.8107553],[98.9733624,18.8084651],[98.9696047,18.8048572],[98.9677674,18.8015107],[98.9520979,18.8097828],[98.9474094,18.8111793],[98.9453548,18.8067615],[98.945843,18.8035318],[98.9432466,18.8041209],[98.9441264,18.8014853],[98.9426458,18.7976919]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","wiki":{"zh":"清邁","en":"Chiang Mai","voyage":"Chiang Mai"}}}